{{!-- Bonus GRIT-cell block (Фокус, renamed to "GRIT") — a flat total, no armor involved:
     a Character's own base pool (GOD.BASE_GRIT/system.baseGrit), or an NPC's GM-set
     NPCDataModel.gritMax. Shared by the Character and NPC sheets, and rendered standalone
     by #patchGritTrack() (actor-sheet.mjs/npc-sheet.mjs) so click/burn/repair/max-±
     actions can patch just this block instead of re-rendering the whole sheet.

     Numeric counter, no text label (2026-08-24 — the mask icon alone stands in for the
     old "GRIT" caption, see its own data-tooltip below). LMB on the whole-value spends
     one point, RMB restores one (temporary — same scene). LMB on the max field burns
     one cell PERMANENTLY (book flavor: GRIT burns, it doesn't "crack" — see
     wounds.mjs's getGritCells doc comment), RMB repairs one — the max field itself
     shows the reduced ceiling (gritTrack.effectiveMax = count - cracked), no separate
     indicator. Resizing the RAW pool (the actor's own baseGrit/gritMax) is a
     character-build action, not a play-time one — deliberately edit-mode-only via the
     dashed "+"/"-" pair, same idiom as Жизни's own max buttons (wound-track.hbs). See
     #onGritWholeClick/#onGritWholeContextMenu/#onGritBurnClick/#onGritRepairClick/
     #onGritMaxAddClick/#onGritMaxSubtractClick in actor-sheet.mjs/npc-sheet.mjs.

     Guard is "has at least one cell OR we're in edit mode" (not hasGrit alone) — an NPC
     with gritMax still at 0 has nothing to show, but edit mode still needs the block to
     exist so its own max "+"/"-" (below) are reachable to raise it off 0 in the first
     place; outside edit mode with zero cells there's nothing to click at all, so it's
     hidden. Max "-" clamps at 0, never rendered disabled at the floor — just a no-op
     past it, same as max "+" has no rendered ceiling either. --}}
{{#if (or gritTrack.hasGrit editMode)}}
<div class="grit-track">
  <div class="grit-counter-row">
    <i class="grit-icon-badge" data-tooltip="GRIT" data-tooltip-direction="UP"></i>
    <span class="grit-counter-value" data-tooltip="ЛКМ — сжечь, ПКМ — восстановить" data-tooltip-direction="UP">{{gritTrack.whole}}</span>
    <span class="grit-counter-sep">/</span>
    <span class="grit-counter-max{{#if gritTrack.cracked}} has-cracked{{/if}}" data-tooltip="ЛКМ — сжечь клетку насовсем, ПКМ — починить{{#if gritTrack.cracked}} (сожжено: {{gritTrack.cracked}}){{/if}}" data-tooltip-direction="UP">{{gritTrack.effectiveMax}}</span>
    {{#if editMode}}
    <button type="button" class="grit-max-sub" title="Уменьшить максимум GRIT на 1">
      <i class="fa-solid fa-minus"></i>
    </button>
    <button type="button" class="grit-max-add" title="Увеличить максимум GRIT на 1">
      <i class="fa-solid fa-plus"></i>
    </button>
    {{/if}}
  </div>
</div>
{{/if}}
